    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Israeli gooheeli geat eemoojiga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida geasoamwa gitaabooda Musa nea ghwayiiy buuneeda; ak aba jeedida geang'waar gideaba siida Amoni ghana siida Moabu maygawa jeeda fuga bwatgeat bea ASEETA; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba mwoatawi fuga Israeli mukaate ea beega, hean geataw Balaamu lapiya aba badaydeaba saawa gideaba ghamwaashta saawa; ng'ata ghwayam ASEETEANYA mooshteayda ghoah ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy buuneeda deaweeda, geanung' gooheeli geat fuga sean bea Israeli ea rabasta mida jeenyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemiya ghwayam geaw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeda miighwahina suh, Eliashibuheeda was ashoohoocheanda, ghayi siloat gang'ula ghushuutka gheeda ASEETEANYA, abeeda ea neekeewa Dobiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda ghayi nideeksa Dobiya ghushadeeda haw ghayi siyiin booga sisaba geadi bea ghadooweeda, ea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi siing'andiita, ea dabita, ea gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea booga, ea difaayi, ea nagheeda, ghayi sirugu gideaba gajeataw fuga Lawi, ea fuga sarmani, ea furiischoodiga dooshta, ea gea jea eataw ashoohoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba damani seaniin aniini ea meandani Yerusalemu, aba gideaba gweaydeaba diktam ea damaniyeenya bea Artashasta was sugoocheanda Babeli hean geaweesi sugoocheanda. Ama ng'ata eawoojisu ng'ay hean geamuschi sugoocheanda beata ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghaahidu Yerusalemu, ak ghaanali ng'asheegiga munyasiin ghayi sin Eliashibu aba badayda Dobiya, ak gwasissa ghushadeeda aba jeeda gheeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaanyareaschi muuchi, hean geajaksi jarooda dabita sean bea Dobiya, gwariteawa jeedeaba ghushadeeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghaanung' eepuus ghushuutka; ak ghaadealdi gah dabita gheeda ASEETA, ea booga sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda, ea haleanjeeda sisapa geadi siing'andiita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaadaayi gideaba eara fuga Lawi miyeataw gida duukusa saawa; hean fuga Lawi ea fuga sarmani, ghayi sin gadiyeeda, gaba nih fwach gawa madamnyeandaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geajaluudayeewi fuga hees nea geayeeshi, “Ghwasaan anda gheeda ASEETA geenung'usa heeda?” Ak ghaabwadi geat saawa, ak ghaanung' gaba nih biikta hoorgeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu fuga sean bea Yuda gilagi aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea booga, ea difaayi, ea nagheeda jeeda heeda siitiiwshacheewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghayiinyi fuga adiiwshachi jea gang'ula heeda siitiiwshacheewa, nea Shelemiya gil was ashoohoocheanda, ea Sadoki, was ng'oorshoocheanda, ea Bedaya was siida Lawi, ak weedaneeda nyaawa ea Hanani gil was orjeeda Sakuri, ea orjeeda Mataniya, aba gideaba suh ea doobiiweadi; ak ea gadiyeeda nyaawa gil gideaba gwalakiisa fuga nyaawa duupchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkaadan, Ea ASEETEANYU, aba badaydeaba suh, ak ea adiibuusi ng'asheega miyaasiin ghayi easinyi aba gheeda ASEETEANYU ea aba gadiyeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eawoojigiga ghaadaayi fuga Yuda muura difaayi eaweeda sabaato, nea suuk ghwasar muschoonga booga ak goodiing'sa badahuuka digeeniga nyaawa; ak eara difaayi, ea sabiibajeega, ea saytuunajeega, ea gilinyoo ea sareenda gil, siyeadu Yerusalemu eaweeda sabaato; ak gearukusi saawa gideaba eaweeda sabaato mwadoabiiwa giileakshooda hamita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara fuga Diro abiita jeeda mujiini, gweadu ghweayeega ea gilinyoo ea haleanjeeda sean gil bea giileakshooda, ak ghwashaayda aba heeda nyaawa eaweeda sabaato aba heeda fuga Yuda, ea aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geawoowsi fuga hees bea Yuda nea geayeeshi saawa, “Nih ng'asheanda muy uurjiin gil oosinyiin, ak ghoang'udi ririnnyeanda eaweeda sabaato?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heapi nih mii gidaghayi sinda ghweanigeagwa aba naweani, ak ASEETEANYA ea mii gweadu ng'asheega munyas sean badaydeanya ea badaydeaba mujiineani? Ak eara gwasa ghoahaachi nyarasta aba badayda fuga Israeli aba gideaba ghoang'udi ririnnyeanda sabaato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nihidu misaneeda aba dooshinga Yerusalemu, nea mii ghwahidu sabaato, ak ghaanung' earat gidaghuudajeega nea gearukuti gideaba adeetin ea ghang'ata sabaato. Ak ghayiinyi fiisu ng'ay bea jeeda fugeasu bea gadiyeeda gafur dooshinga, aba gideaba adeeyeadu giliwas sareenda eaweeda sabaato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean fuga ageakshachi ea gea shaah haleanjeeda sean siikghaas gwalla jarooda aba Yerusalemu nibwagi ghana nibiyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geawoowsi saawa nea geayeeshi, “Ghwasaan anda goolilli aba madeeda ghamarda? Inyas goobiikti gicha gaydaang'waanyeagwa.” Ghang'eada damandida ea mudeapka eaweeda sabaato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gearukusi fuga Lawi gideaba ghoamiidu geat ak ghapka gafur dooshinga, nea ghoaghaydiit eaweeda sabaato. Apkaada eara nih aba jeeda alooheedeanyu, Ea ASEETEANYU, ak gisiksean aba seang'ayda bariinyeagaagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba jeedeaba eawoojigiga ghaadaayi fuga Israeli nea ghaghi gadeemga eemeeda Ashdodi, ea Amoni, ea Moabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea diibiga nyaawa silach bugusta baloola iita Ashdodi, nea meebaloolana iita fuga Yuda, gabaloola iita eemoojiga sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geawoowsi saawa nea ghaamwaashti saawa nea ghaabwarji mwaatkwa ea dalootiida buudeega nyaawa; nea ghaanung' ghwaak habeawooda aba gheawunga ASEETA nea geayeeshi, “Adoatawji haweegeagwa orjooga nyaawa, ghana gideaba gaygageena orjoogeagwa haweega nyaawa, ghana agoogeesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada Sulemani was sugoocheanda Israeli ea mii gwasin riing'eeda aba badayda gadeemga. Aba jeeda eemoojiga saang'a manda sugoocheanda uurji niny, ak ASEATAANYI ghabwariiy niny ak ghwanung' ASEETA goombal niny fuga Israeli sean; ak geabwada nih ghwanung' gadeemga rabasta gwasin niny riing'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeeleeyseegwa iit aba sinoodeaba ng'asheesu sean hees munyasiin oosisi ASEETEANYA aba gheenda gadeemga rabasta?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
