          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak orjeanagi bea jeeda orjooga Yodaya, ea orjeeda Eliashibu was ashoohoocheanda haw, nea abeeda ea orjeeda agweaji Sambalati gil was siida Horoni; hean ghaahoani niny heedeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apkaada saawa, Ea ASEETEANYU aba gideaba ning'uda ririnnyeanda ashoohoocheanduumeeda ea neajeeda ashoohoocheanduumeeda ea fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaamiidu saawa ea haleanjeeda sean bea rabasta ak ghaanung' gaba nih ang'waay galandaanyi ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak gaba nih bea gadiyeadaanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
